                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>richTextValue</name>
                    <value>&lt;h2&gt;If you are on duty, work these top to bottom.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Waiting for a person&lt;/b&gt; comes first. Someone asked for a human and is currently getting silence. Reach them the way the record says they can be reached, and never by telephone unless it says so.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Awaiting a decision&lt;/b&gt; is next. Each of these has a date by which the interactive process is due, and the ones closest to it are at the top. Nobody here is chasing their own request; that is the point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Needs an interpreter&lt;/b&gt; is last only because it is smallest. Signed video is never machine translated; it waits on a person, and the wait is the entire cost to the person waiting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;You will not find a diagnosis on any record here. There is no field for one. If someone asks you what a person has, the answer is that nobody knows and nobody can find out.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
                </componentInstanceProperties>
